WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.044 --> 00:00:09.013
&gt;&gt;&gt; Smoke from the devastating

00:00:09.146 --> 00:00:11.081
wildfires in Canada impacting

00:00:11.215 --> 00:00:12.650
millions here in the united

00:00:12.683 --> 00:00:12.883
States.

00:00:13.017 --> 00:00:14.818
Schools are closed and outdoor

00:00:14.952 --> 00:00:16.654
events are being canceled as the

00:00:16.654 --> 00:00:18.656
smoke creates the world's worst

00:00:18.756 --> 00:00:20.658
air pollution in New York City.

00:00:20.658 --> 00:00:21.892
&gt;&gt;&gt; We are standing by for an

00:00:22.026 --> 00:00:24.662
update from the Vatican as pope

00:00:24.662 --> 00:00:26.997
Francis is undergoing abdominal

00:00:27.131 --> 00:00:28.666
surgery, stomach surgery, at

00:00:28.699 --> 00:00:29.333
this very moment.

00:00:29.466 --> 00:00:31.335
What we are learning about the

00:00:31.468 --> 00:00:32.703
86-year-old's procedure.

00:00:32.836 --> 00:00:34.672
&gt;&gt;&gt; For the first time in modern

00:00:34.672 --> 00:00:36.774
history a former vice president

00:00:36.907 --> 00:00:38.676
is running against his former

00:00:38.676 --> 00:00:38.909
boss.

00:00:39.043 --> 00:00:41.679
CNN is on the trail in Iowa as

00:00:41.812 --> 00:00:44.682
Mike pence makes it official.

00:00:44.682 --> 00:00:45.749
This is CNN "News central."

00:00:45.883 --> 00:00:55.993
♪♪

00:00:56.126 --> 00:00:57.428
&gt;&gt;&gt; You are now looking at a

00:00:57.561 --> 00:01:00.264
live picture of New York City.

00:01:00.698 --> 00:01:01.765
Yeah, it's really smoky.

00:01:01.899 --> 00:01:03.233
More than 30 million people are

00:01:03.367 --> 00:01:05.102
under air quality alerts this

00:01:05.235 --> 00:01:06.704
morning as smoke from wildfires

00:01:06.837 --> 00:01:08.806
in Canada is pouring to the

00:01:08.939 --> 00:01:11.408
south, shrouding U.S. Cities

00:01:11.542 --> 00:01:12.710
across the northeast,

00:01:12.776 --> 00:01:14.044
mid-atlantic and midwest.

00:01:14.178 --> 00:01:14.979
New York City public schools

00:01:15.112 --> 00:01:17.247
have canceled outdoor activities

00:01:17.381 --> 00:01:18.248
today because of the air

00:01:18.382 --> 00:01:18.716
quality.

00:01:18.716 --> 00:01:19.583
At one point yesterday the city

00:01:19.717 --> 00:01:22.953
topped the list of the world's

00:01:23.087 --> 00:01:23.487
worst air pollution.

00:01:23.620 --> 00:01:25.189
And you can see in these

00:01:25.322 --> 00:01:26.357
pictures new yorkers could

00:01:26.724 --> 00:01:28.158
barely make out the city's

00:01:28.292 --> 00:01:30.361
iconic skyline.

00:01:30.728 --> 00:01:31.829
I took some of this video

00:01:31.962 --> 00:01:33.597
yesterday, this is from midtown,

00:01:33.731 --> 00:01:35.065
Manhattan, and there is some

00:01:35.199 --> 00:01:36.834
video also coming in from the

00:01:36.967 --> 00:01:37.835
upper west side.

00:01:37.968 --> 00:01:39.269
Hard to see those buildings

00:01:39.403 --> 00:01:40.738
there in the background.

00:01:40.771 --> 00:01:45.109
Now, in Canada's capital city of

00:01:45.242 --> 00:01:47.177
ottawa an Orange haze took over

00:01:47.311 --> 00:01:48.746
the skyline for weeks now.

00:01:48.746 --> 00:01:51.015
Firefighters in Canada have been

00:01:51.148 --> 00:01:55.853
battling wildfires in British

00:01:55.986 --> 00:01:59.957
Columbia and Nova Scotia.

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:01.125
Quebec is the biggest hot spot

00:02:01.258 --> 00:02:04.762
at the moment with more than 150

00:02:04.762 --> 00:02:05.696
active wildfires burning.

00:02:05.829 --> 00:02:08.032
All of it is expected to keep

00:02:08.165 --> 00:02:10.234
U.S. Cities blanketed with smoke

00:02:10.367 --> 00:02:11.168
into tomorrow.

00:02:11.301 --> 00:02:12.836
CNN's Athena Jones is joining us

00:02:12.970 --> 00:02:14.338
from here in New York.

00:02:14.772 --> 00:02:15.305
What are the conditions now?

00:02:15.439 --> 00:02:17.341
I can see a little bit of haze

00:02:17.474 --> 00:02:20.911
still out there behind you.

00:02:21.045 --> 00:02:21.879
&gt;&gt; Reporter: Good morning, Sara.

00:02:22.012 --> 00:02:23.247
That's exactly right.

00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:25.282
You can look out across the

00:02:25.416 --> 00:02:26.850
Hudson, you can see off in the

00:02:26.984 --> 00:02:28.318
distance that's Jersey City, new

00:02:28.452 --> 00:02:30.354
Jersey, you can see another

00:02:30.788 --> 00:02:31.855
sightseeing boat taking off.

00:02:31.989 --> 00:02:33.290
We've seen a lot of people

00:02:33.424 --> 00:02:34.792
trying to go about their daily

00:02:34.925 --> 00:02:37.694
lives, running, some wearing

00:02:37.828 --> 00:02:39.329
masks, some not wearing masks

00:02:39.463 --> 00:02:41.331
but the hazy and smoky

00:02:41.465 --> 00:02:42.099
conditions continue.

00:02:42.232 --> 00:02:43.534
This is all about health and

00:02:43.667 --> 00:02:43.867
safety.

00:02:44.001 --> 00:02:44.802
This is why we're seeing

00:02:44.835 --> 00:02:46.270
officials here in New York City

00:02:46.403 --> 00:02:47.771
and officials and agencies up

00:02:47.905 --> 00:02:49.039
and down the northeast all the

00:02:49.173 --> 00:02:50.441
way down to Raleigh, north

00:02:50.808 --> 00:02:52.810
Carolina, I should say, telling

00:02:52.943 --> 00:02:54.311
people to be cautious, to limit

00:02:54.445 --> 00:02:55.579
their time outdoors.

00:02:55.712 --> 00:02:57.247
This looks a bit better than it

00:02:57.381 --> 00:02:59.049
did at least to my eye last

00:02:59.183 --> 00:02:59.349
night.

00:02:59.483 --> 00:03:00.818
It looked last night like there

00:03:00.818 --> 00:03:02.119
was a cloud that the descended

00:03:02.252 --> 00:03:02.986
straight on the city.

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:05.322
If you look at the numbers

00:03:05.456 --> 00:03:07.024
they're still at very unhealthy

00:03:07.157 --> 00:03:08.826
levels when it comes to the air

00:03:08.826 --> 00:03:09.326
quality index.

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:10.828
These are pollutants that are

00:03:10.828 --> 00:03:12.830
among the tiniest and most

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:14.431
dangerous pollutants it's called

00:03:14.832 --> 00:03:18.035
pm 2.5, particulate matter.

00:03:18.168 --> 00:03:20.838
It's so tiny when you inhale

00:03:20.838 --> 00:03:23.907
this stuff it can go deep into

00:03:24.041 --> 00:03:24.842
your lungs and pass into the

00:03:24.842 --> 00:03:25.642
bloodstream and cause health

00:03:25.776 --> 00:03:30.280
problems like asthma,

00:03:30.414 --> 00:03:30.914
respiratory issues, heart

00:03:31.048 --> 00:03:32.316
disease and can make anyone

00:03:32.449 --> 00:03:33.484
suffering from that thing the

00:03:33.617 --> 00:03:34.952
symptoms much, much worse.

00:03:35.085 --> 00:03:36.053
That is why we're seeing schools

00:03:36.186 --> 00:03:38.388
here in the city and upstate in

00:03:38.522 --> 00:03:40.157
central New York, ten school

00:03:40.290 --> 00:03:41.525
districts canceling outdoor

00:03:41.658 --> 00:03:41.892
activity.

00:03:42.025 --> 00:03:44.495
We know that mayor Adams in new

00:03:44.862 --> 00:03:46.130
York is about to hold a press

00:03:46.263 --> 00:03:47.164
conference next hour to give us

00:03:47.297 --> 00:03:48.899
an update on what to expect, but

00:03:49.032 --> 00:03:50.367
we know that of course you don't

00:03:50.501 --> 00:03:51.902
want to be at the top of the

00:03:52.035 --> 00:03:54.872
list of most polluted cities in

00:03:54.905 --> 00:03:55.472
the world and that's why new

00:03:55.606 --> 00:03:56.874
York has been over the last

00:03:56.874 --> 00:03:57.040
couple days.

00:03:57.174 --> 00:03:58.876
&gt;&gt; You hear a lot of people

00:03:58.876 --> 00:04:00.878
talking about that, Athena and I

00:04:01.011 --> 00:04:02.880
notice you're wearing a mask.

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:03.814
Everyone thinks of covid when

00:04:03.947 --> 00:04:05.215
they see the mask but this is

00:04:05.349 --> 00:04:06.350
what you do in places like

00:04:06.483 --> 00:04:07.551
California where I live to try

00:04:07.684 --> 00:04:09.620
to keep yourself safe from huge

00:04:09.753 --> 00:04:10.320
amounts of smoke.

00:04:10.888 --> 00:04:12.456
I appreciate your reporting

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:13.890
today.

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:14.892
Let's go to CNN meteorologist

00:04:14.892 --> 00:04:17.694
Derek van dam who is joining us

00:04:17.828 --> 00:04:18.228
now.

00:04:18.362 --> 00:04:19.696
Derek, how long is this expected

00:04:19.830 --> 00:04:21.965
to go on?

00:04:22.099 --> 00:04:23.200
&gt;&gt; Yeah, share ration this is

00:04:23.333 --> 00:04:25.669
definitely one of those days as

00:04:25.802 --> 00:04:27.337
an asthmatic you don't want to

00:04:27.471 --> 00:04:28.972
step out the door without your

00:04:29.106 --> 00:04:30.440
asthma pump because it could

00:04:30.574 --> 00:04:31.508
literally save your life.

00:04:31.642 --> 00:04:32.910
To answer your question, I think

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:34.178
we've got at least another day

00:04:34.311 --> 00:04:35.913
where we're going to have this

00:04:36.046 --> 00:04:37.814
brown hazy smoke in the sky.

00:04:37.948 --> 00:04:39.183
Now, you may have enjoyed maybe

00:04:39.316 --> 00:04:42.286
the beautiful sunrises and sun

00:04:42.419 --> 00:04:44.121
sets as this cloud is in the

00:04:44.254 --> 00:04:45.355
upper levels of the atmosphere,

00:04:45.489 --> 00:04:46.924
too, it blocks out the sun, it

00:04:46.990 --> 00:04:49.726
filters out the shortwave

00:04:49.860 --> 00:04:50.994
lengths and leaves us that red

00:04:51.128 --> 00:04:52.529
hue, but when it settles to the

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:54.364
ground it becomes an issue.

00:04:54.498 --> 00:04:55.432
Athena has been appropriately

00:04:55.566 --> 00:04:56.934
reporting on that because

00:04:56.934 --> 00:04:58.335
obviously this has major health

00:04:58.468 --> 00:05:00.204
implications for people like

00:05:00.337 --> 00:05:01.505
myself who is an asthmatic.

00:05:01.638 --> 00:05:02.940
Just take a look at the national

00:05:03.040 --> 00:05:04.007
mall in Washington, D.C., it's

00:05:04.141 --> 00:05:05.342
not only New York City, it's

00:05:05.475 --> 00:05:07.077
also Philadelphia, it's also

00:05:07.211 --> 00:05:08.946
Baltimore and our nation's

00:05:09.012 --> 00:05:09.413
capital.

00:05:09.546 --> 00:05:11.315
The big apple, though, jostling

00:05:11.448 --> 00:05:13.116
with what was the notoriously

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:15.886
most polluted city in the world,

00:05:16.019 --> 00:05:18.956
deli, India, one time topping

00:05:18.989 --> 00:05:20.324
the list of the most polluted

00:05:20.457 --> 00:05:21.892
cities in the entire planet.

00:05:22.025 --> 00:05:22.292
Incredible.

00:05:22.426 --> 00:05:25.662
You have to look to the

00:05:25.796 --> 00:05:26.964
satellite imagery to see what is

00:05:26.964 --> 00:05:27.231
going on.

00:05:27.364 --> 00:05:28.966
Last night we saw a wall of

00:05:28.966 --> 00:05:31.835
smoke progressing across lake

00:05:31.969 --> 00:05:35.038
Ontario from the wildfires in

00:05:35.172 --> 00:05:36.406
Quebec and that is what we will

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:37.507
see in the hours and days to

00:05:37.641 --> 00:05:37.808
come.

00:05:37.941 --> 00:05:38.976
The fires will be burning for

00:05:39.076 --> 00:05:40.143
several more days if not weeks

00:05:40.277 --> 00:05:42.012
and that smoke all dependent on

00:05:42.145 --> 00:05:43.280
the wind direction is going to

00:05:43.413 --> 00:05:45.249
filter it into some of the most

00:05:45.382 --> 00:05:47.985
populated areas all registers

00:05:48.118 --> 00:05:50.420
unhealthy to hazardous levels of

00:05:50.554 --> 00:05:51.421
particulate matter that Athena

00:05:51.555 --> 00:05:52.456
was talking about.

00:05:52.589 --> 00:05:53.757
Here is the smoke forecast, you

00:05:53.890 --> 00:05:55.759
can see kind of another large

00:05:55.892 --> 00:05:57.861
area, a plume of smoke will be

00:05:57.995 --> 00:05:58.996
filtering in through the rest of

00:05:58.996 --> 00:06:00.998
the workweek and that is why we

00:06:00.998 --> 00:06:02.132
have so many million Americans

00:06:02.266 --> 00:06:03.867
under this air quality alert

00:06:04.001 --> 00:06:05.869
currently impacting not only the

00:06:06.003 --> 00:06:08.205
quality of the air, but also the

00:06:08.338 --> 00:06:09.940
visibility that you and I see as

00:06:10.073 --> 00:06:20.651
we step --

00:06:21.018 --> 00:06:23.053
&gt;&gt; I can tell you I can actually

00:06:23.186 --> 00:06:25.656
feel the same feeling that I got

00:06:25.789 --> 00:06:27.424
there after some time, headaches

00:06:27.557 --> 00:06:29.126
and a little congestion.

